119 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 57 0 R/E(We unite Rajasthani families to celebrate our traditions, build lifelong friendships and inspire the next generation of leaders. Whether your roots are in Rajasthan or Australia, RAJKOV welcomes everyone with the warmth of family.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

120 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 57 0 R/E(From vibrant cultural festivals and family gatherings to youth leadership, community service and professional networking, we create opportunities to connect, grow and give back. Proud of our heritage and inspired by Australia's multicultural spirit, we are preserving our traditions while building a stronger future together.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

