128 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 58 0 R/E(In 2003, far from our homeland but united by our shared Rajasthani roots, six families came together with a simple dream\204to create a home away from home for Rajasthanis in Victoria.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

129 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 58 0 R/E(What began as informal gatherings to celebrate our festivals, speak our language, and support one another soon grew into RAJKOV \205 Rajasthani Kutumb of Victoria. The vision was never just to organise events, but to build a family where every Rajasthani would feel welcomed, connected, and proud of their heritage while embracing life in Australia.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

