144 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 59 0 R/E(Brij Panwar co-founded RAJKOV in 2003 with five other families to preserve Rajasthani culture, connect future generations to their roots, and build a supportive community in Australia. As RAJKOV's first Secretary, and later Vice President and President, he laid the foundation for the organisation's growth. His home remains RAJKOV's registered address, and his continued mentorship, guidance and service as Returning Officer have helped shape the inclusive and vibrant community RAJKOV is today.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[5]>>
