<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 63 0 R/E(This year, the RAJKOV Committee has taken a proactive approach to strengthen our community by launching the Youth Committee and RAJKOV Youth Band to empower the next generation. We introduced a pre-planned annual calendar with early venue bookings, making it easier for families to plan and ensuring well-organised events. Membership has been enhanced with Unique Annual & Life Member Family IDs and an Early Bird RAJKOV Coin initiative to encourage timely renewals. We have also started early engagement with sponsors and are actively pursuing government grants and council funding opportunities to support community programs and ensure the long-term sustainability of RAJKOV. Together, these initiatives are helping build a stronger, more connected, and future-ready community.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

