242 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 65 0 R/E(Our parents and grandparents brought with them the colours, traditions and values of Rajasthan. Now it's our turn to keep that spirit alive\204not just by celebrating festivals, but by creating new memories, building friendships and shaping what it means to be a proud Rajasthani in Australia.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[8]>>
