261 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 66 0 R/E(I hope this message finds you well! I wanted to take a moment to discuss something that is very dear to me\204our wonderful heritage and its significance for our future here in Australia. Our parents traveled all the way from Rajasthan, carrying with them a wealth of traditions and a vibrant culture. Now, it's our opportunity to carry that legacy forward and define what Rajasthani culture will look like for the next generation.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

